            Compute confidence scores <math id="algorithm1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S=\{s_{1},s_{2},\dots,s_{n}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S=\{s_{1},s_{2},\dots,s_{n}\}</annotation></semantics></math> using adapter router <math id="algorithm1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math> for prompt <math id="algorithm1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>;

</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.11" class="ltx_listingline">
