<div id="S5.SS1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Power consumption.</span>
We compare <span id="S5.SS1.p7.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">EdgeLoRA</span>  with <span id="S5.SS1.p7.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">llama.cpp</span> in terms of the power consumption across various settings. Power consumption data is collected using jetson-stats <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">Bonghi, 2023</a>)</cite>, a monitoring tool for system status on Jetson devices. We record power consumption every second and calculate the average across all requests. Table <a href="#S5.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ 5.1. End-to-End Results on Synthetic Workloads ‣ 5. Evaluation ‣ EdgeLoRA: An Efficient Multi-Tenant LLM Serving System on Edge Devices" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> shows that <span id="S5.SS1.p7.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">EdgeLoRA</span> achieves higher energy efficiency than <span id="S5.SS1.p7.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">llama.cpp</span>. Moreover, <span id="S5.SS1.p7.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">EdgeLoRA</span> achieves higher throughput while requiring less computation time to process a given number of requests, resulting in greater power savings.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T11" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S5.T11.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 11</span>. </span><span id="S5.T11.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Power consumption (Watt) comparison between <span id="S5.T11.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">llama.cpp</span> and <span id="S5.T11.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">EdgeLoRA</span> cross devices.
</span></figcaption>
